 "s01.png", "id": "1290313560836135", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1290313564169468_1944919212542852064_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tJ8NkjD76EAQ7kNvwEHmU8f&_nc_oc=AdqaZn61xtf4BFXRmMP0Zq0U0OXHPZpw120BYX1QX5Z4NOkS7VTByIcVvH0Xu3i3eWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJF5eukzNcz2SobD5SjqtAsP6eEbZGKeCWj6nHWoXsuA&oe=6AFDCBDC"}, {"file_name": "s02.png", "id": "1733073644664645", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1733073661331310_5629461049321258325_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qpw73zqnLBQQ7kNvwF6YAT9&_nc_oc=Adqfa_LTVlXaqVQauaqULe1CjCYl4xA4ll--x5_mHArEndTvLHwks58Z6688CB3yvQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_f189sOEXLCzzum07OdbucFDEd8AB5pjSODKY0REOmA&oe=6AFDBA2B"}, {"file_name": "s03.png", "id": "1875467957141997", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1875467960475330_1872312137828573140_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2asXgpVuWQIQ7kNvwEnuXbq&_nc_oc=Adodud6T3xCLN59KFREZnKk5ZiJW9TNjBotHb3jZnGTirpnIbXv9ByY4kgdoRcTy8jg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1ldptgPtWmKWqeNGlPEYecjjcV67DqNdQ2ZEJLAGUow&oe=6AFDB022"}, {"file_name": "s05.png", "id": "2480112452457438", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_2480112455790771_8140092662538143972_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aUHWSJ8f7lcQ7kNvwF92QfQ&_nc_oc=AdqCwBRbtiWhfK5GAzMmSqLAyH_spMkIyzsyRnjxAxKsU-qbQLeszO7nEUlD3n8gf58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRhImGAAZqzsGiCLw4nVMUMXD6XeAWYO_H_BG6XIcXxw&oe=6AFDBFD7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art-2.png", "id": "1343471021008476", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1343471024341809_1635249537243616296_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o0Z-_PXvwowQ7kNvwH79bhY&_nc_oc=Adpu3EOkJ4s2wNsbn2bQG5zUVHbZ4pGXfWvWQY9IIkCsA3nQ2Fg_ag87lcCe7x2snzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfrmaAim16xxG49apvIf-UAYwJHX43kv_urt7jVdEnkg&oe=6AFDB962"}, "display_name": "Omega Pilot Evolution", "keywords": ["racing", "futuristic", "speed", "antigravity", "Scifi"], "long_description": "Omega Pilot Evolution is a high-speed first-person VR racing experience. Take control of futuristic anti-gravity ships and master precision piloting across dynamic tracks built for extreme speed.\n\n**Career Mode**\n\nRace against recorded runs of real players, improve your skills, and progress through increasingly challenging tracks.\n{1074932615539098}\n\n**Series Mode**\n\nCompete against AI opponents in a series of races and fight for the top position.\n\n**Single Race Mode**\n\nChoose a track and race against AI opponents at your own pace.\n\n**Cross-Platform Multiplayer**\n\nRace against real players in real time and play with friends across different platforms. VR and non-VR players can race together in the same multiplayer sessions!\n\n**Combat Racing Mode**\n\nCollect weapons, use shields, and outmaneuver your opponents in high-speed races.\n\n{1099198279368277}\n\n**Combat Arena Mode**\n\nFly freely around the arena, collect weapons, and battle real players or AI opponents.\n\n**Customization & Upgrades**\n\nEarn in-game currency to upgrade your ship's speed, acceleration, handling, and braking. Unlock visual customizations to create your own style.\n\n{29482518374711634}\n\n**Asynchronous Rivals & Global Leaderboards**\n\nChallenge the recorded runs of other players, set your best times, and climb the global leaderboards.\n", "short_description": "High-speed first-person VR racing experience"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xocus.co/privacy-policy-eng", 